  "schema": 1,
  "scope": "24 actual validation-only FFmpeg trials on four fixed CPU-encoded outputs from two retained 9s synthetic 1440x810 30fps AAC sources. Linux FFmpeg7.1.5 four CPU quota. Ordinary: concurrent decoded FFprobe source/output frame clocks, concurrent source/output audio packet PTS/duration/SHA then strict output decode; combined: same source clock with concurrent strict output decode+frame clock, same packet comparison. Independent oracle before timing: both FFprobe clocks, audio PTS/duration/hash, strict output decode and separate streamhash. All 270 frames, 423 audio packets; output/source SHA unchanged; combined clock vs independent reference within 1us. No new encodes, no actual GPU output, no C# full job or publication timing. Three alternated pairs each; local script reads retained fixtures, not uploaded. Raw numbers transcribed from JSONL.",
